#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""arcade-admin: manage the student games on the CMU-Q arcade box.

Run it over SSH on the box (as user `es`):

    arcade-admin                 interactive menu
    arcade-admin list            table of games
    arcade-admin add URL         add a game (public -> HTTPS, private -> deploy key)
    arcade-admin semester GAME S tag a game with its semester (one menu entry per semester)
    arcade-admin --help          everything else

See docs/ADMIN.md in the arcade-box-starter repo for the full story.
This tool is deliberately not reachable from the EmulationStation menu.
"""

